        <summary>
          <para>The operation failed because it was blocked. For example, a device policy may be blocking the operation, a package verifier may have blocked the operation, or the app may be required for core system operation. The result may also contain EXTRA_OTHER_PACKAGE_NAME with the specific package blocking the install.</para>
